                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RESOLVE-TERM-0059.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FILE-ACCESS-0060.
               EXEC CICS WRITE FILE('KSDSVA96')
                         FROM(KSDSVA96-REC)
